{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1209357-is-scion-origins-out-confused-as-hell-here","id":1209357,"title":"Is Scion origins out? Confused as hell here...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-20T12:51:02-07:00","id":1209357,"title":"Is Scion origins out? Confused as hell here...","content":"Sorry if this seems like a dumb question, but is Scion origins actually out yet? I know I missed the Kickstarter, but is there I way I can get in on any of the early release stuff? I'm chomping at the bit for this series and have money I'd love to throw at it...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6111-thecosmicgoose","name":"thecosmicgoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T13:14:34-07:00","id":1209367,"title":"","content":"No, draft text was shared with backers. It\u2019s not the formatted pdf with art yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T13:53:59-07:00","id":1209390,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1209357-is-scion-origins-out-confused-as-hell-here?p=1209367#post1209367\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, draft text was shared with backers. It\u2019s not the formatted pdf with art yet.</div> </div> </div> </div>The draft of Hero 2e also got shared with backers.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T15:07:10-07:00","id":1209785,"title":"","content":"I believe you can go to Backerkit to pre-order the books and then you'll be able to get the drafts of Origins and Hero <i>that</i> way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-27T10:16:12-07:00","id":1212345,"title":"","content":"Please excuse me if this is something of a faux pas to just say outright but I'm pretty hesitant to &quot;pre-order&quot; a book that is creeping up on a year overdue (edit: on the KS page anyway, sorry, just noticed that the estimate on the Backerkit page is October '17 which is still out of date), considering that I haven't found a single public update about the delay? I'm assuming the backers have been receiving some sort of news but it's honestly a little weird and off-putting for someone just coming in.<br /> <br /> Unless I am just incredibly blind and missing something obvious...?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2279-mister-wizard","user":"Mister Wizard","date":". 04-27-2018, 01:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2279-mister-wizard","name":"Mister Wizard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2279_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-27T20:35:26-07:00","id":1212528,"title":"","content":"Us backers have the no-frills no-art version right now and I think it will definitely be worth the wait.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10179-shadryx","name":"shadryx","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-28T03:59:27-07:00","id":1212589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mister Wizard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1209357-is-scion-origins-out-confused-as-hell-here?p=1212345#post1212345\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Please excuse me if this is something of a faux pas to just say outright but I'm pretty hesitant to &quot;pre-order&quot; a book that is creeping up on a year overdue (edit: on the KS page anyway, sorry, just noticed that the estimate on the Backerkit page is October '17 which is still out of date), considering that I haven't found a single public update about the delay? I'm assuming the backers have been receiving some sort of news but it's honestly a little weird and off-putting for someone just coming in.<br /> <br /> Unless I am just incredibly blind and missing something obvious...?</div> </div> </div> </div>Kickstarter estimates have always been just that: Estimates. There have been near-monthly updates along the way for the Kickstarter backers informing us about the status and the progress along the way.<br /> <br /> Also, just a year off from original estimates? I backed the Exalted Kickstarter. That was a REAL fustercluck.<br /> <br /> Edit: Also, while the Backerkit may not officially say &quot;Sorry about the delay&quot; there have been regular progress reports via the OPP Monday Meeting Notes, in addition to the KS updates.<br /> <br /> What I'm trying to say is that communication and engagement between the creative team and the fans has been great","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":2142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","user":"Kyman201","date":". 04-28-2018, 08:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-28T08:24:43-07:00","id":1212672,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1209357-is-scion-origins-out-confused-as-hell-here?p=1212589#post1212589\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What I'm trying to say is that communication and engagement between the creative team and the fans has been great</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, I think it's more that communication with the backers has been good. (I wouldn't say great -- there was a 2-3 month gap where I was going &quot;...and what's happening next?&quot;) The Monday Meeting Notes have been fairly sparse and kind of unhelpful for people who don't have the backer update side of the story. So I can see the frustration. I don't think it warrants suspicion, but I don't know that I'd be wanting to pre-order something at this point. Once I missed the Kickstarter, I'd at least be waiting until a firm-ish street date had been announced.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24028-mike-mccall","name":"Mike McCall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24028_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-28T10:07:44-07:00","id":1212709,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mike McCall</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1209357-is-scion-origins-out-confused-as-hell-here?p=1212672#post1212672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> To be fair, I think it's more that communication with the backers has been good. (I wouldn't say great -- there was a 2-3 month gap where I was going &amp;quot;...and what's happening next?&amp;quot<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> The Monday Meeting Notes have been fairly sparse and kind of unhelpful for people who don't have the backer update side of the story. So I can see the frustration. I don't think it warrants suspicion, but I don't know that I'd be wanting to pre-order something at this point. Once I missed the Kickstarter, I'd at least be waiting until a firm-ish street date had been announced.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, put that way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-29T14:08:33-07:00","id":1213182,"title":"","content":"I'll still wait until there's an actual book. I don't care about the art, but I'll wait for rules and text that have been polished a bit more.<br /> <br /> I am looking forward to Scion 2e, though. For all its rules-roughness in places, Scion 1e gave me the best campaign of my life.<br /> <br /> Dean Shomshak","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1175-dshomshak","name":"DShomshak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"197"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}